<h3 id="answer-hint">Answer Hint</h3>

<p>Suppose we know the solution for first n houses, now to find the solution for <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">n</code> th house</p>
<ol>
  <li>We can either rob the nth house
      If we rob the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">n</code> th house we can use the solution of <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">n-2</code> th house and add amount in nth house to it.</li>
  <li>We can leave the nth house
     If we do not want to rob <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">n</code> th house we can just use the solution for <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">n-1</code> th house.</li>
